    "type": "question",
    "label": "44",
    "prompt": "Simplify the following.\n$$\\frac{a^4}{a^6}\\times(3a^2)^3$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$27a^4$, $a\\ne0$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{a^4}{a^6}\\times(3a^2)^3&=27a^{4-6+2\\times3}\\\\\\frac{a^4}{a^6}\\times(3a^2)^3&=27a^4\\end{align*}$$\nThe original denominator requires $a\\ne0$.",
